{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One fateful day, our protagonist chanced upon a strange cat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A stray cat with a beautiful lavender coat and an empty stomach.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Our protagonist decided to share the rice ball he was holding with the cat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The next day, he woke up to find...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A girl with cat ears sleeping blissfully under the same blanket as him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The girl, Nekomata Okayu, tells him she has nowhere to go, and so they begin living together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With the introduction of the mysterious Okayu, our protagonist's uneventful life will never be the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What secrets does Okayu hold? How will their relationship develop? This is a story about the budding bond between the two\u2014more than friends but less than lovers\u2014as they tackle life, sharing both tears and laughter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get ready for a heartwarming story about living with Nekomata Okayu!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625380/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c83.png?t=1744968183\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ADV with a fully-voiced storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the rich story that branches off from one chapter to the next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Operate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left click/Enter - Next page</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Right click/Space - Hide window</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ctrl - Skip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AUTO, SAVE, and other buttons - Left-click t